wonderful twist. Climb, swing, and bounce your way through a growing world filled with unique maps, crazy game modes, and a bustling social hub where anything can happen.\n\nWhether you're a competitive tag pro or just here to vibe, Proboscis! has something for everyone. Challenge your friends in a variety of modes, from classic tag to custom minigames, or explore the mall \u2014 a central hangout spot where you can shop, chill, and meet other players.\n\nKey Features:\n\n\ud83e\udd8d Physics-based movement \u2013 no buttons, just pure arm-powered fun\n\n\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Tons of game modes \u2013 from fast-paced tag to wild, experimental minigames\n\n\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f A fully explorable mall packed with surprises\n\n\ud83c\udfae Frequent updates, seasonal events, and community-driven content\n\n\ud83e\udde2 Cosmetic items and customization so you can express your inner Proboscis\n\nProboscis! is more than a game \u2014 it\u2019s a growing world powered by the community. Join the chaos, make new friends, and see what\u2019s around the next corner... or rooftop.\n\nAre you ready to swing into the madness?", "short_description": "Proboscis! is a fast-paced VR climbing and tag game inspired by Gorilla Tag. Explore a vibrant world full of unique game modes, hang out with friends at the mall, Proboscis! offers nonstop action and goofy fun."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/proboscisvr/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TIMMEH And Friends", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/proboscisvr/home?authuser=0", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "interne